  "**Not inlined** at -O{0}: {1}/Heading of the hover shown on a call the optimizer rejected. {1} is the reason, e.g. \"too costly\".Rendered as Markdown: ** ** makes text bold - keep the markers attached to the text they wrap.-O0 / -O1 / -O2 is a compiler optimization-level flag. Never translate it and never separate the O from its digit.": "-O{0}에서 **인라인화되지 않음**: {1}",
